Aim: To extract a substring from a given string.

Algorithm:
1. Start.
2. Declare a string.
3. Specify starting and ending positions.
4. Use substring().
5. Display the substring.
6. Stop.

class Substring {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s="Hello Java";
        System.out.println(s.substring(0,5));
    }
}
